…NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL苏长荣：这灵蛇丹的原料珍贵、难寻，虽说每月出一次，但分到每个人手上的量确实不多，我实在不够啊！少侠就行行好，把灵蛇丹卖给我吧，出多少钱我都愿意！NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}},{type="showbutton",args={3,1}},{type="showbutton",args={4,1}}},caozuoName2="交谈",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"YEL苏长荣：少侠就把灵蛇丹卖给我吧，出多少钱我都愿意！NOR"}}},caozuoName3="卖给他",buttonShow3=0,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={{type="gaintab",args={"39003",9}},{type="doc",args={"YEL苏长荣：多谢少侠！多谢少侠！我、我这就……NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={[[CYN苏长荣十分激动，在身上掏了一阵后略显尴尬地说，NOR
